2026-09-04 15:43:52.462 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: sAchieveID=NONE,m_sGlobalName=BD_ACH_PARTY,m_nValue=-1
2026-09-04 15:43:53.143 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1759	20416620	3242777	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xff9aa2d5Yoshimo^-: ^0xffbed7d7So, there is sanity in all this madness. If you are not in league with the evil that dwells in this unholy place, Yoshimo begs your assistance. ^-
2026-09-04 15:44:01.258 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1760	20416620	3250892	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffd6bd9fJaheira^-: ^0xffbed7d7A fair line easily used by servants of the wizard themselves. We have been imprisoned and worse, and given many reasons to distrust strangers we encounter.^-
2026-09-04 15:44:03.871 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1761	20416620	3253505	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xff9aa2d5Yoshimo^-: ^0xffbed7d7I share your sentiments. I have seen much here that has disturbed me. I myself am a warrior with no evil intentions. Please, I would welcome any assistance you might offer.^-
2026-09-04 15:44:05.726 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1762	20416620	3255360	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffd6bd9fJaheira^-: ^0xffd7c8a0Then assistance you shall get, Yoshimo. What ails you, friend?^-
2026-09-04 15:44:05.726 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1763	20416620	3255361	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xff9aa2d5Yoshimo^-: ^0xffbed7d7I am not sure how I came to be here... like you, I suspect. I have been trying to find my way out, but I was wounded in my attempt to do so.^-
2026-09-04 15:44:07.367 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1764	20416620	3257001	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffd6bd9fJaheira^-: ^0xffd7c8a0Tell me, how did you come to be trapped here? ^-
2026-09-04 15:44:07.367 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1765	20416620	3257001	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xff9aa2d5Yoshimo^-: ^0xffbed7d7It is actually quite uh... embarrassing. My profession does not leave itself open to those who are not wary, yet somehow I was caught unaware.^-
2026-09-04 15:44:08.376 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1766	20416620	3258010	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xff9aa2d5Yoshimo^-: ^0xffbed7d7I came to Athkatla years ago from Kara-Tur to seek my fortune. At some point, I went to bed in my room at the Copper Coronet, and I awoke in a strange room with a very sore head.^-
2026-09-04 15:44:09.010 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1767	20416620	3258644	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xff9aa2d5Yoshimo^-: ^0xffbed7d7I do not know how long I was there before awaking.^-
2026-09-04 15:44:10.968 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1768	20416620	3260602	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffd6bd9fJaheira^-: ^0xffd7c8a0Do you think that we are in Athkatla?^-
2026-09-04 15:44:10.968 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1769	20416620	3260602	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xff9aa2d5Yoshimo^-: ^0xffbed7d7I am unsure. I may have been drugged when I was brought here. I may have been unconscious... either way, I do not know how long.^-
2026-09-04 15:44:11.937 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1770	20416620	3261571	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xff9aa2d5Yoshimo^-: ^0xffbed7d7If it was the former, this place could be anywhere. If it was the latter, then I don't imagine that I could have traveled very far without noticing.^-
2026-09-04 15:44:12.574 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1771	20416620	3262208	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xffc0a1aaMinsc^-: ^0xffbed7d7Then you too know the hardship of being set into a maze like a helpless hamster! We are comrades in peril! Boo asks what you propose we do next, little man.^-
2026-09-04 15:44:13.080 BaldursGateIIEnhancedEdition[26058:118586130] INFO: LUA: A7LOG	1772	20416620	3262714	Day 3, Hour 3 (5 Mirtul, 1369)	WORLD_DIALOG_CONFIRM	^0xff9aa2d5Yoshimo^-: ^0xffbed7d7I do not know a way to escape this place. Perhaps we could search for this exit together.^-
